• Primary: GPT-4 Turbo for complex reasoning
• Visual: GPT-4V for screenshot analysis
• Structured: Native structured output support
• Caching: OpenAI prompt caching when available
• Fallback: Claude-3.5 for redundancy
• Local: Llama 3.1 for privacy-sensitive operations

**Cost Optimization:**
• Smart routing based on complexity score
• Prompt caching (60-80% savings)
• Context compression techniques
end note

note right of VectorDatabase
**RAG Implementation Details:**
• Vector Store: FAISS for fast local search
• Cloud Scale: Pinecone for production scaling
• Embeddings: OpenAI text-embedding-3-large
• Search Strategy: Hybrid semantic + keyword
• Performance: <200ms retrieval latency
• Accuracy: 85%+ relevance on BPG patterns

**Knowledge Pipeline:**
1. Embed BPG patterns and entities
2. Create vector index with metadata
3. Semantic search with filters
4. Re-rank by business relevance
end note

