note right of StructuredAssembly
**Structured Outputs with Pydantic:**
```python
from pydantic import BaseModel, Field
from typing import List, Optional

class GUIAction(BaseModel):
    action_type: str = Field(..., description="Type of GUI action")
    target_element: str = Field(..., description="CSS selector or xpath")
    parameters: dict = Field(default_factory=dict)
    confidence: float = Field(..., ge=0.0, le=1.0)
    reasoning: str = Field(..., description="Business logic explanation")

class AutomationPlan(BaseModel):
    actions: List[GUIAction]
    fallback_strategy: Optional[str] = None
    estimated_duration: int = Field(..., description="Seconds")
    risk_level: str = Field(..., regex="^(low|medium|high)$")

# LLM Integration
response = openai.chat.completions.create(
    model="gpt-4",
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": prompt}],
    response_format={"type": "json_schema",
                    "json_schema": AutomationPlan.model_json_schema()}
)
```
end note

note right of ProcessStorage
**Function Calling Architecture:**
```python
from typing import Dict, Any

@tool
def validate_business_constraint(entity_id: str, action: str, context: Dict[str, Any]) -> bool:
    """Validate action against business rules from BPG"""
    bpg_rules = neo4j.get_business_rules(entity_id)
    return all(rule.validate(action, context) for rule in bpg_rules)

@tool
def get_similar_workflows(current_context: Dict[str, Any]) -> List[Dict]:
    """Retrieve similar successful workflows from BPG"""
    embeddings = openai_embeddings.embed(str(current_context))
    similar = faiss_index.search(embeddings, k=5)
    return [workflow.to_dict() for workflow in similar]

@tool
def execute_pattern_template(template_id: str, parameters: Dict[str, Any]) -> Dict[str, Any]:
    """Execute parameterized business process template"""
    template = bpg.get_pattern_template(template_id)
    return template.execute_with_validation(parameters)
```

**Tool Integration:**
• Deterministic business logic execution
• BPG knowledge access functions
• Validation and constraint checking
• Template-based pattern execution
end note

